---
title: Workspace Configuration
sidebar:
  order: 2
---
You can configure your workspace settings to customize how your organization appears and operates in Taskip.

1. Log in to your **Taskip account.**
1. Go to **Settings**.
1. Click **Workspace**.

In the Workspace settings, you will find the following sections:

## **Company**

Manage your **company information and business details** from the Company settings.

Select **Company** under Workspace. From here, you can update the following information:\
**Basic Information**

- **Name** – Enter your company name.
- **Email Address** – Add your business contact email.
- **Company Website** – Provide your official website link.
- **Address** – Enter your company address.
- **Select Industry** – Choose the industry your business belongs to (e.g., Manufacturing).
- **Description** – Add a short description of your company.

**Branding**

- **Logo** – Upload your company logo.
  - Supported formats: **PNG, JPG, GIF (up to 5MB)**
- **Signature** – Upload your company signature for documents or communications.
  - Supported formats: **PNG, JPG, GIF (up to 5MB)**

After making the necessary updates, click **Save Changes** to apply them.

## **Domain Setting**

You can configure a **custom domain** for your Taskip workspace to enable a full **white-label experience.**

1. Select **Domain Settings** under Workspace
1. You will find your **Current Domain**, which is automatically assigned by Taskip.

Example -`https://popus.taskip.app` (Primary)

You can continue using the default domain if you prefer.

3. Add your **Custom Domain**. Enter a fully qualified subdomain (e.g., crm.yourdomain.com)
1. Click **Add Domain** and configure the required **DNS records** with your domain provider.
1. Once DNS is set correctly, verify the domain.

## **Workspace SEO**

Configure the **metadata** for your Taskip workspace to improve search visibility and sharing previews.

Go to **Settings > Workspace >Workspace SEO.**

SEO Settings:

- **Meta Title** – Enter the title that will appear in search engine results.
- **Meta Description** – Add a short description for your workspace that appears in search results.
- **OG Image** – Upload an Open Graph image for social sharing.
  - Recommended size: **1200x630px**
  - Maximum file size: **5MB**

Click **Save Changes** to apply your SEO settings.

## **Appearance Settings**

The Appearance tab allows you to personalize your Taskip workspace to reflect your brand identity.

**Steps to customize your appearance:**

1. Go to&nbsp;**Settings → Workspace → Appearance.**

![](image-28-1024x776.png)

2. Upload your&nbsp;**Brand/Profile Image**&nbsp;(company logo) to display on your portal.

![](image-29.png)

3. Upload a&nbsp;**Favicon**&nbsp;for browser tabs to reinforce your brand.

![](image-30.png)

{% table %}
---
- Tip: Use high-quality images for your logo and favicon to maintain a professional look across devices.
{% /table %}

4. **Coming soon:**&nbsp;Customize&nbsp;**Theme Color**,&nbsp;Page Color, and&nbsp;Calendar View&nbsp;for a fully branded experience.

![](image-31-1024x781.png)

{% table %}
---
- &nbsp;Note: Appearance settings apply to all workspace users and clients.
{% /table %}

## **Country & Region**

The Country & Region tab lets you configure regional settings for your workspace, ensuring accurate scheduling, reporting, and localized experiences for your team and clients.

**Steps to set Regional Preferences:**

1. Go to&nbsp;**Settings → Workspace → Country & Region.**

![](image-32-1024x737.png)

2. Select your&nbsp;**Country**,&nbsp;**State**,&nbsp;**City**, and enter your&nbsp;**Zip Code**.

![](image-36-1024x232.png)

3. Choose your preferred&nbsp;**Language**&nbsp;and&nbsp;**Currency**&nbsp;using the dropdown menu.

![](image-33-1024x351.png)

4. Set your&nbsp;**Timezone**,&nbsp;**Time Format**&nbsp;(12-hour or 24-hour), and&nbsp;**Date Format**&nbsp;using the dropdown menu.

![](image-34-1024x212.png)

{% table %}
---
- Tip: Make sure your timezone and date/time formats match your team’s location to avoid scheduling conflicts.
{% /table %}

5. Click&nbsp;**Save**&nbsp;to apply your preferences.

![](image-35-1024x255.png)

**Note:** These settings affect all workspace users and client-facing views.

## **Workspace Information**

Describe your workspace, add Workspace name and Workspace description.

![](image-42.png)

## **Delete Workspace**

You can permanently delete your Taskip workspace from the&nbsp;**Company**&nbsp;tab.

**Steps to delete your workspace:**

1. Go to&nbsp;**Settings → Workspace → Company.**
1. Scroll down to the&nbsp;**Delete Workspace**&nbsp;section.
1. Read the warning carefully:\
   *“&nbsp;This will permanently delete your entire workspace, including all calendars, team members, bookings, and associated data. This action is irreversible — please proceed with caution.”*
1. Click&nbsp;**Delete Account**&nbsp;to confirm.

![](image-37-1024x201.png)

{% table %}
---
- Important: This action cannot be undone. Make sure to export any important data before deleting your workspace.
{% /table %}
